# Unity Editor Bridge Handbook — Unity CLI

Operating manual for the AI ↔ Unity Editor bridge. Read before running `unity command` in Bash or
calling any `mcp__unity-editor-mcp__*` tool. The full CLI reference is the `unity:unity-cli` skill
(plugin `unity@claude-plugins-official`) or `unity skill show`; this file holds the **project
rules** on top. Unity's migration guide:
https://docs.unity.com/en-us/unity-cli/replace-mcp-server-unity-cli

